CHANGES IN VERSION 0.1.7
--------------------------

USER VISIBLE CHANGES
    o Extended spCCA from supporting 2 biological datasets to a generalized framework supporting n biological datasets (input provided as a list)

NEW FEATURES
    o Updated data standardization procedure to use standard deviation scaling instead of variance scaling, reducing noise amplification and preventing low-variance feature inflation.
    o Introduced a flexible lambda search strategy, allowing users to choose between:
	* Exhaustive grid search
	* Random search with a user-defined number of sampled lambda combinations
    o Improved computational performance through:
	* Enhanced parallelization
	* Reduced maximum iteration threshold for model convergence

BUG FIXES
    o -

